  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-18T21:46:04.632Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "My password manager can't auto-fill the login for VRChat because it's using its proprietary input fields.\n\n Would love to see a more native login screen that I could actually log in with without having to switch over to my password manager to manually copy and paste the password.",
